  "id": "study-of-values",
  "term": "Study of Values",
  "definition": "Study of Values refers to a scientific inquiry into value as a relation between a person and objects of desire, judgment, or action. In this historical account, it grew from psychological analyses of economic value and aimed at a broader theory explaining how values arise and change in individual and social consciousness.",
